<title>SINGAPORE: Clipsal to supply gear to Sydney Olympics.</title>
<headline>Clipsal to supply gear to Sydney Olympics.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clipsal Industries said on Thursday its Australian associate Gerard Industries Pty Ltd had been appointed the official provider of electrical accessories and building automation for the Sydney 2000 Olympic Games.</p>
<p>A company statement said as official provider, Gerald Industries will involve extensive commitment to the development of the infrastructure of the Olympic site.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
